  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cycle of Hope: Empowering Refugees through Bicycle</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Cycle of Hope&quot; project aims to make a positive impact on the lives of Syrian refugee students in Lebanon by providing them with bicycles as a mean of transportation to school and a source of entertainment .  This initiative recognizes the profound importance of bicycles and new schoolbags in promoting their physical and emotional well-being, fostering social integration, and empowering them to explore new opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
